    5. Create col_labels using the same color order but independently sampled run lengths (same K-way partition of N-1, each 1-3).
    6. Set corner = last color in the shared ordering.
    7. Fill interior with background; place row_labels on right edge, col_labels on bottom edge, corner at bottom-right.
